<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables - Marvel Entertainment, Three-Five Systems and Tech-Sym.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables - Marvel Entertainment, Three-Five Systems and Tech-Sym.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that Marvel Entertainment Group Inc, Three-Five Systems Inc and Tech-Sym Corp were not available for after hours trade for news.</p>
<p>The NYSE said that Corimon SACA and Fruehauf Trailer Corp were also unavailable after hours.</p>
</text>
